  "title": "EEG-Speech Brain Decoding Dataset",
  "description": "This dataset contains EEG recordings paired with vocal audio recordings from participants performing an overt speech production task, in which they read aloud visually presented text. It was collected to support brain decoding of speech from EEG. The data are organized in BIDS by recording date session and run, and include code for preprocessing, model training, and evaluation, as well as derivative outputs from a standard preprocessing pipeline.",
  "methods_description": "Participants vocalized visually presented text (speechopen task) while EEG and audio were recorded. EEG was stored in EDF format and vocal recordings as WAV files, organized by session (recording date) and run.",
